{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find yourself on a secluded island where nature and time seem to have stopped. There is no rush here - just you, the world around you and endless opportunities for exploration and development. Collect resources, create tools, build structures and solve small tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the secrets of the island and develop your survival skills. There are no enemies here - just you and nature. Enjoy meditative gameplay designed to relax and enthrall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Stylized graphics and overhead view</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Calm and relaxing survival without pressure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Varied quests and progression system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Flexible crafting and base expansion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Discovering new territories and secrets of the island</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695140?t=1746273931","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695140?t=1746273931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695140/f413dfa89f83714c224a3a6306e509eb0782069c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746273931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695140/f413dfa89f83714c224a3a6306e509eb0782069c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746273931","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find yourself on a secluded island where nature and time seem to have stopped. There is no rush here - just you, the world around you and endless opportunities for exploration and development. Collect resources, create tools, build structures and solve small tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the secrets of the island and develop y